<title>USA: Westin plans stock offering next year.</title>
<headline>Westin plans stock offering next year.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westin Hotels &amp; Resorts on Friday said it or an affiliate is considering an initial public offering of common stock in 1997 and currently expects to file a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission in the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>In a statement, Westin said it currently expects the proceeds of the offering will be used for general corporate purposes, including the repayment of indebtedness.</p>
</text>
